APP_NAME=Laravel
APP_ENV=local
APP_KEY=
APP_DEBUG=true
APP_URL=http://localhost

LOG_CHANNEL=stack
LOG_DEPRECATIONS_CHANNEL=null
LOG_LEVEL=debug

DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=laravel
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=

BROADCAST_DRIVER=log
CACHE_DRIVER=file
FILESYSTEM_DRIVER=local
QUEUE_CONNECTION=sync
SESSION_DRIVER=file
SESSION_LIFETIME=120

MEMCACHED_HOST=127.0.0.1

REDIS_HOST=127.0.0.1
REDIS_PASSWORD=null
REDIS_PORT=6379

MAIL_MAILER=smtp
MAIL_HOST=mailhog
MAIL_PORT=1025
MAIL_USERNAME=null
MAIL_PASSWORD=null
MAIL_ENCRYPTION=null
MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=null
MAIL_FROM_NAME="${APP_NAME}"

AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=us-east-1
AWS_BUCKET=
AWS_USE_PATH_STYLE_ENDPOINT=false

PUSHER_APP_ID=
PUSHER_APP_KEY=
PUSHER_APP_SECRET=
PUSHER_APP_CLUSTER=mt1

MIX_PUSHER_APP_KEY="${PUSHER_APP_KEY}"
MIX_PUSHER_APP_CLUSTER="${PUSHER_APP_CLUSTER}"

Based on the system's seeders and the current database state, here are the login credentials for the various user roles. All passwords default to password in this development environment.

1. Super Admin
This role has full access across all societies and is the only one that can manage payment types and global configurations.

Email: dezuh@mailinator.com
Password: password


2. Society Admin (Gaur Enclave)
This is the primary administrative account for the "Gaur Enclave" society.

Email: aadhargaur41@gmail.com
Password: password


3. Society Admin (Ganesh Nagar)
This is the administrative account for the "Ganesh Nagar" society.

Email: ganesh_admin@example.com
Password: password


4. Regular Member (Resident)
To test the system from a resident's perspective, you can use any of the emails listed in the Members module. If a user record exists for them, the default password is also password.

TIP

Use the Super Admin (dezuh@mailinator.com) credentials to verify the Payment Type field fix and the flexible payment recording features we just implemented.
